# Environment variables — names only, never real values. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored).
# Each task that reads a new variable adds its name here with who reads it and whether it is public.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are bundled into client code: never put a secret in one.
# Feature flags are on only when the value is exactly "true".

# Playwright (npm run test:e2e). Optional.
# E2E_BASE_URL: run against an already running app instead of starting `next dev`.
E2E_BASE_URL=
# E2E_PORT: port for the dev server Playwright starts (default 3000; a worktree for issue <n> uses 3000 + <n>).
E2E_PORT=
# E2E_SERVER: "start" makes Playwright serve the production build (`next start`, run `npm run build` first)
# instead of `next dev`; CI sets it.
E2E_SERVER=
